# Copy to .env only if you want the studies to load anatomy geometry from somewhere other than
# the local examples/public/assets copy. Vite exposes VITE_-prefixed variables to the browser.
#
# Unset (the default): the studies fetch /assets/anatomy/*.stl and /assets/heart/*.stl from
# examples/public/assets — run `pnpm fetch-assets` once to populate it (the folder is git-ignored).
#
# Set: every study fetches the geometry from this origin instead. This is what the site deploy
# uses, so the 169 MB of STL never enters the Cloudflare Pages upload. Must end with a slash.
# VITE_ASSET_BASE=https://assets.3dviz.dev/
# The bucket's r2.dev URL works as a fallback if the custom domain is unavailable:
# VITE_ASSET_BASE=https://pub-806fd6c18b78408eb30af9617c73dfc1.r2.dev/
